    "title": "Neptune blanks Matawan behind balanced team effort - Field hockey recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reed Becker ,\n39 minutes ago Neptune defeated Matawan 3-0 in Neptune behind a balanced scoring attack. Neptune scored one goal in each of the first three quarters of the match. Neptune’s goals were scored by Julia Loff, Claire Browning and Rafaela Sharin. Jewel Lucien recorded nine saves in net, earning the shutout. Neptune (3-10)... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
